  message: "Re-scoped per wave3 §A row 9 (tracker hygiene, no code). Original split-premise — framework_dispatch mixing framework names (fastapi/starlette) with mechanism/pattern categories (registry_dispatch 89%, native_websocket, rust_trait_dispatch) — is RESOLVED by audit-findings 0014's meta-key partition: the 9 pattern/mechanism rows fold to meta.detection_pattern, the 56 framework-named rows stay in meta.framework_dispatch, so the field now holds framework names only (shipped Wave 5 of WI-runod, audit 0014 status All RESOLVED). KEEP framework_dispatch. This item now tracks the ADR-0028 Open Question 2 promotion-threshold decision: post-fold framework_dispatch sits at ~30 distinct values × ~30 producers (the ADR-0024 §Fold-residue-discipline rule-3 threshold); whether to promote it from an Edge.meta key to a dedicated Edge.framework: str|None field is a human architectural call gated on diverse-corpus steady-state emission-count confirmation (self-analysis under-counts) → needs_human_review."  # 4e19
